        <div class="preco">R$ 35</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- GALERIA -->
<section class="galeria" id="galeria">
  <div class="section-title reveal">
    <h2>NOSSA <span>GALERIA</span></h2>
    <p>Trabalhos recentes</p>
  </div>
  <div class="galeria-grid">
    <div class="galeria-item reveal" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621605815971-fbc98d66573f?w=600&q=80')"></div>
    <div class="galeria-item reveal" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585747860715-2ba37e788b70?w=600&q=80')"></div>
    <div class="galeria-item reveal" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599351431202-1e0f0137899a?w=600&q=80')"></div>
    <div class="galeria-item reveal" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622286342621-4bd786c2447c?w=600&q=80')"></div>
    <div class="galeria-item reveal" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503951914875-452162b0f3f1?w=600&q=80')"></div>
    <div class="galeria-item reveal" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519345182560-3f2917c472ef?w=600&q=80')"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DEPOIMENTOS -->
<section>
  <div class="section-title reveal">
    <h2>O QUE DIZEM <span>NOSSOS CLIENTES</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="depoimentos-grid">
    <div class="depoimento reveal">
      <div class="estrelas">★★★★★</div>
      <p>"Melhor barbearia da cidade! Atendimento top e o corte fica perfeito. Virei cliente fiel."</p>
      <div class="autor">— Rafael S.</div>
    </div>
